task context;
examples;
constraints;
irrelevant information;
context pollution.
Build
Three versions of the same AI application using different context architectures.

Learn:
JSON Schema;
validation;
typed data;
required fields;
optional fields;
enums.
Build
Free text customer inquiry →
validated Lead object.

Learn:
hallucination;
grounding;
