Classify systems.
Explain why some should NOT be agentic.

Learn:
tool definitions;
schemas;
arguments;
tool results;
tool choice;
validation.
Build
Tools such as:
calculator;
database lookup;
mocked external service.
Model chooses correct tool.

Learn:
retries;
timeouts;
invalid arguments;
tool errors;
maximum iterations;
infinite loops;
budget constraints.
Failure Lab
Create a looping agent.
Add safeguards.

Agent From Scratch
Must contain:
multiple tools;
routing;
limits;
structured final result;
error recovery;
execution logs;
budgets.
Frameworks forbidden.

Convert broad research goals into:
subquestions;
actions;
evidence requirements.
Build
Research planner.

Learn:
source quality;
primary sources;
secondary sources;
freshness;
citations;
contradictions.

Agent determines:
what is known;
what is missing;
whether further research is justified;
when research should stop.

Learn:
citation verification;
duplicate evidence;
disagreement;
missing evidence.
Build
Evidence table.

Research Agent
Student receives specification only.
Must build system that:
accepts research goal;
plans;
searches;
gathers evidence;
records sources;
detects contradiction;
performs follow-up research;
stops appropriately;
creates sourced report.
Mentor operates primarily in hint mode.

Learn:
SQL;
tables;
rows;
keys;
queries;
indexes;
transactions.
Start with SQLite.
Introduce PostgreSQL concepts.

Distinguish:
application state;
conversation state;
workflow state;
persistent data.
Build
Stateful conversation system.

Distinguish:
short-term memory;
working state;
long-term memory;
semantic memory;
episodic memory;
user preferences.

Problems:
incorrect memory;
stale memory;
duplicate memory;
privacy;
over-personalization.
Build
Memory write policy.

Personal Memory Agent
Supports:
remember;
retrieve;
update;
ignore;
delete.
All memory actions auditable.

Learn:
chunks;
metadata;
indexes;
vector search.
Test chunk sizes.

Learn:
filters;
lexical + semantic search;
top-k;
reranking;
context assembly.

Learn:
wrong retrieval;
missing retrieval;
false grounding;
retrieval contamination;
context overload.
Create retrieval eval dataset.

